  "releaseNotes": "- Add TranslatePositive and TranslateNegative format strings to TranslateBinding Extension for branching on numeric sign.\n- Split FallbackValue and TargetNullValue (raw object) from new FallbackText and TargetNullText (localized resource keys) in TranslateBinding Extension; both can be combined so the text becomes the resource key and the value a format argument.\n- Broaden numeric handling in TranslateBinding Extension so TranslateZero and TranslateOne match double, decimal, float, long, sbyte, and short in addition to int.",
